WEBVTT

00:15:56.829 --> 00:16:00.871
which is having put these kinds of
decision heuristics and cognitive biases

00:16:00.871 --> 00:16:05.704
on the map. Which one do you fall victim
to the most? Is that confirmation bias?

00:16:05.704 --> 00:16:09.121
It sounds like maybe not. I just
wondered which of which of

00:16:09.121 --> 00:16:12.454
the biases that you've documented
is your greatest demon.

00:16:12.912 --> 00:16:18.246
All of them, really. All of them, except,
as you said, confirmation bias.

00:16:19.037 --> 00:16:22.079
By the way, people are close
to me find this irritating.

00:16:22.496 --> 00:16:25.787
That is that whenever they have
a problem with someone,

00:16:26.496 --> 00:16:28.662
I automatically take the other side

00:16:29.037 --> 00:16:32.537
and try to explain that someone
might be right after all.